  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "心內話 - 非洲夜未眠"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">非洲夜未眠</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 蔡苾瑋</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiR3SGqPW2s734pL1UP0iJVmmI5kuBQAPpa9XkB3vDJ6CKJwgx68ME1CwzzVOepUKb92dFKy2UDtFpwYqNkCSyv0ht0ZTQAbQslWTqdwzTj2qfwGzceONuNcusFjevp8zr3K20y1E5KQlCmM0titBIuZa7anNOArm_BnOLuFORhb9CflD0Kg-d_E0ieGoEW\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjK6JX7mtgsveno2W57xyDoE5AlKg7teru1YpAWlKLqqX21oHft27hk7RO9S4KYsEcB-KHh2MAsVNstkh1Wwa30Zqkf7ihM-qt5Cb9tUN85WFbfcv2gjW9XBUFK5o-cvX_uac4jt6nT2GfflYMgpMfKDi8n9jEsZ0Xy-3ubiF0jng4d7CKR6Ako-KisFd_2\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhZq4tbkAtvn1jzNUYXxNJOaSYPuuOkSLMQ4ut_cwJSwYIcZLKpOfoI0-dzhFPaqZ2LkGfWVlBqdUD2JUvJYhETj0HEiq-koESX9GBCKIbDF7oUZyUammk1YxezZSX3lvQE76u9GB6fY76pX1x5WYXvUKZT3sQAzqgj0tGx0OEgD4Kal1IUCHnpJXi6N9RX\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRfFVaD1OOCvDFr6IpMu2AJyV3Treglp_-D1wc4MlVaAb9igauM7VHfgOZUjK_B6uh1htpDG8FQ9VVRRbzxJ6s5XPODZw0kUQ6L5rrXOTTvl6nAjNm9idfHoSG_ktc9aMud17B81yJzKlEuTdAtaVMKm9dH6O_0oOfqPQH19H2EtTqANf_2qRfsQETj3uq\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\n        Ē記得人生頭擺ê全台語親子ió-gà（『瑜伽』）就是tī新竹母語囡仔窟</span><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">1</span>辦--ê，我第二个嬰仔teh-beh一歲--ah，總算有機會koh tńg來tsia，tsiok思念逐家。Tsit擺beh tshuā逐家「來去非洲tshit-thô」<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">2</span>！<br /><br />頭起先，先pun機票hōo逐家，眾人講我tshuân kah真厚工，直直kā我呵咾，我感覺歹勢歹勢。集合了後，tsiah-koh tshuā囡仔沓沓仔check in入場，囡仔提著機票就一直問：「等--leh kám是beh坐飛行機？」有影是古錐kah！我應講：「Lán m̄-nā ē坐飛行機，koh是頭等艙有掠龍kah眠床ê機型--neh。」<br /><br />Suà--落，我tshuā大細漢囡仔鬥陣做出飛行機ê屈勢，飛tsiūnn天、飛落地，有夠刺激--ê。降落了後，阿母kā身軀屈做三角形ê磅空kheh sio倚，hōo囡仔nǹg--過-去，我huan咐逐家：「行李m̄-thang放bē記--得--őo！」囡仔tsua̋nn變做揹仔hōo阿母āinn--leh，身軀竟然ē-sái án-ne sńg，逐家笑kah làu-ē-hâi。<br /><br />Chloe機長隨koh變身導遊，介紹非洲有特色ê所在kah suà--落-來ê按算。準備出發！我tuì後壁ê「家私頭仔山」提出圓箍仔pun hōo逐家，原來是beh坐jì-puh去SAFARI<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">3</span>，開車進前要先試看ha̋ng-tóo-luh、雨撇仔、lá-pah、油門kám ē tín動，千里鏡也tio̍h gīm hōo tiâu。<br />規路khám-khám-khia̍t-khia̍t，jì-puh幌kah tsiânn厲害，囡仔無驚--著，顛倒是笑hai-hai。今仔日SAFARI有拄著用鼻仔一隻牽一隻行路ê象群，真趣味，落尾阿母kah囡仔兩个做伙扮tsiânn濟ió-gà動物——有倒頭栽ki-ki叫ê猴山--a；有頷頸長長、m̄-koh無leh háu ê麒麟鹿；有跤骨kah象仝款粗ê陸龜，ē-sái規年thàng天lóng無lim水；有ngia̍uh-ngia̍uh趖koh ē吐舌ê蛇，ài細膩m̄-thang去hōo咬--著。<br /><br />上尾用夜光枝（『螢光棒』）做收煞。今仔日用台語舉辦親子ió-gà，逐家sńg kah píng--過，m̄-nā好sńg，koh ē-tàng健身訓練，有影是「一兼二顧，摸lâ仔兼洗褲」！\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tg-annotations\" style=\"border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666666; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; padding: 15px 10px 0px;\">1 編註：新竹地區ê一个台語親子共學團體。<br />2 編註：Tsit篇是leh記錄作者辦親子ió-gà ê內容，「來去非洲tshit-thô」是tsit擺活動ê主題。<br />3 編註：Tsit个詞是uì非洲ê Swahili語來--ê，原本ê意思是旅行，傳入英語了後意思沓沓仔變做是「tī非洲觀察野生動物ê活動」。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjNiVwx6-77-SDULgj3q_bfHrUo3_Roo6-fMTHVqrNFfDeL-o1vio8JNE9ttAr4juuoLBCoqWQ6-5qs_iB9pGdVTb4Fx16bMNui_feJU0V7T55gpISpW383Hs1sXfZ08leSSo0pL1xgP9W9oImlsdNIowsKpQE18TyjKLQL8Z02EqrK7mCeBuIDefeAxh60\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 388期，2026年07月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
